# Build output and run state, not sources.
#
# bin/ holds engine binaries that build/build-sagan.sh produces; they are only
# valid for the Nix store of the machine that built them. work/ is wiped and
# rebuilt on every engine run. country.mmdb is generated by
# config/make-country-mmdb.py, which is both the recipe and the documentation
# of what the database contains.
bin/
work/
build/sagan-src/
config/country.mmdb
